description: Never use em dashes or en dashes; use ASCII hyphen-minus only
alwaysApply: true
---

# ASCII hyphens only (On IT Portal)

Never insert Unicode dashes. That includes em dash (U+2014), en dash (U+2013), figure dash (U+2012), and horizontal bar (U+2015).

Always use ASCII hyphen-minus (`-`) for ranges, asides, titles, and empty placeholders.

```
# Bad (unicode dashes)
Hours 08:00 to 18:00 written with an en dash
Edit Client written with an em dash then Acme

# Good
Hours 08:00-18:00
Edit Client - Acme
Wait 1-2 minutes
Empty value: -
```
